<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ameritrade, Nationwide Financial.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ameritrade, Nationwide Financial.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Credit Suisse First Boston said on Monday analyst Sam Liss had started coverage of both Nationwide Financial Services Inc and AmeriTrade Holding Corp with ratings of buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in AmeriTrade opened down 1/2 at 16-3/4. Those of Nationwide Financial closed on Thursday at 26-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
